    "description": "Are you a skilled Marketplace Manager looking for your next big career move? HomeLane Ventures Solutions in Ghaziabad offers you the perfect platform to grow professionally and personally.\n\nAbout HomeLane Ventures Solutions:\nHomeLane Ventures Solutions is a leading organization in the Hybrid sector, committed to excellence, innovation, and employee growth. We offer a dynamic work environment where talent is recognized and rewarded.\n\nKey Responsibilities:\n• Collaborate with logistics partners to ensure timely delivery\n• Track key performance indicators including GMV, conversion rate, and ROI\n• Build and maintain affiliate and influencer marketing programs\n• Manage marketplace relationships with Amazon, Flipkart, and Meesho\n• Manage customer reviews, ratings, and return/refund processes\n• Optimize product pages for search visibility and conversion\n• Execute digital marketing campaigns across Google, Meta, and other channels\n\nRequired Skills & Qualifications:\n• B.Com / M.Com / MBA Finance\n• 0-1 years of relevant experience\n• Proficiency in Product Management\n• Proficiency in Supply Chain\n• Proficiency in Digital Marketing\n• Proficiency in Shopify\n• Proficiency in Google Analytics\n• Proficiency in Data Analytics\n• Proficiency in Influencer Marketing\n• Proficiency in Email Marketing\n\nWork Mode: Hybrid - Flexible work-from-home and office\n\nWhat We Offer:\n• Provident Fund and Gratuity as per company policy\n• Employee stock options (ESOPs) for eligible roles\n• Company-sponsored certifications\n• Flexible working hours\n• Recognition and rewards programs\n• Work-from-home flexibility\n• Salary Range: 2.5 LPA - 6 LPA per annum\n\nLocation: Ghaziabad, Uttar Pradesh, India\n\nIf you are excited about this opportunity, apply now and take the next step in your career journey with HomeLane Ventures Solutions!",
